Relevant tables, columns, and their potential usage for the requested analysis  

• ORDER_ITEMS."product_id": links each order‑line to a product – needed for join to PRODUCTS.  
• ORDER_ITEMS."sale_price": revenue of the individual order‑line – needed for profit calculation.  
• ORDER_ITEMS."created_at": micro‑second epoch time of the order‑line – needed to group results by month (months < 2024‑01).  
• PRODUCTS."id": primary key to join with ORDER_ITEMS."product_id".  
• PRODUCTS."cost": product unit cost – subtract from "sale_price" to obtain profit/line.  
• PRODUCTS."name": for reporting the top product each month.  
(No status filters are required because the task says “include all order items regardless of their status”.)  

Typical join/condition ideas  

• JOIN ORDER_ITEMS oi ON oi."product_id" = p."id"  
• WHERE oi."created_at" < 1704067200000000        -- (micro‑seconds for 2024‑01‑01 00:00:00 UTC)  

Below are ten exploratory Snowflake SQL queries (LIMIT 20 rows each) from basic inspection to a compact version of the final result.  
All column names are enclosed in double quotes and each query is preceded by a short description.

```sql
-- 1) Description: Quick look at a few order‑lines to understand available fields.
SELECT 
    oi."id",
    oi."order_id",
    oi."product_id",
    oi."sale_price",
    oi."created_at",
    oi."status"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description: Inspect a few product records that will be joined to order‑lines.
SELECT 
    p."id"               AS "product_id",
    p."name",
    p."cost",
    p."retail_price",
    p."distribution_center_id"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS" p
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Description: Combine an order‑line with its product to see cost vs. sale_price (single rows).
SELECT 
    oi."id"             AS "order_item_id",
    oi."product_id",
    p."name",
    oi."sale_price",
    p."cost",
    (oi."sale_price" - p."cost") AS "profit_per_line",
    oi."created_at"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
  ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Description: Aggregate total profit per product across all time (top 20 products).
SELECT 
    p."id"        AS "product_id",
    p."name",
    SUM(oi."sale_price")               AS "total_revenue",
    SUM(p."cost")                      AS "total_cost",
    SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")    AS "total_profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
  ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
GROUP BY p."id", p."name"
ORDER BY "total_profit" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Description: Show raw month string (YYYY‑MM) produced from micro‑second epoch for 20 sample rows.
SELECT 
    TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM')  AS "order_month",
    oi."product_id",
    oi."sale_price"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS" oi
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Description: Total profit per product per month (any months, limit 20 arbitrary rows).
SELECT
    TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM')              AS "order_month",
    oi."product_id",
    SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                            AS "profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
  ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
GROUP BY 1, 2
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Description: Rank products by profit within each month (restricted to months prior to 2024‑01).
SELECT
    month_profit."order_month",
    month_profit."product_id",
    p."name",
    month_profit."total_cost",
    month_profit."total_profit",
    RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY month_profit."order_month" ORDER BY month_profit."total_profit" DESC) AS "profit_rank"
FROM (
    SELECT
        TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
        oi."product_id",
        SUM(p."cost")                             AS "total_cost",
        SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")           AS "total_profit"
    FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
    JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
      ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
    WHERE oi."created_at" < 1704067200000000     -- before 2024‑01‑01
    GROUP BY 1, 2
) month_profit
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS" p
  ON p."id" = month_profit."product_id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Description: Final‑style answer, but restricted to 20 rows so we can preview the output shape.
SELECT
    t."order_month",
    t."product_id",
    p."name"                      AS "top_product_name",
    t."total_cost",
    t."total_profit"
FROM (
    SELECT
        mp.*,
        RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY mp."order_month" ORDER BY mp."total_profit" DESC) AS rnk
    FROM (
        SELECT
            TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
            oi."product_id",
            SUM(p."cost")                             AS "total_cost",
            SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")           AS "total_profit"
        FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
        JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
          ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
        WHERE oi."created_at" < 1704067200000000
        GROUP BY 1, 2
    ) mp
) t
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS" p
  ON p."id" = t."product_id"
WHERE t.rnk = 1
ORDER BY t."order_month"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Description: Count of order‑items per calendar month (helps verify volume trend).
SELECT
    TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ("created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
    COUNT(*)                                                   AS "order_lines"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"
GROUP BY 1
ORDER BY 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Description: Show 20 highest‑profit order‑lines (single lines) before 2024‑01 for manual inspection.
SELECT 
    oi."id",
    TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP_LTZ(oi."created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM') AS "order_month",
    p."name",
    oi."sale_price",
    p."cost",
    (oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                  AS "profit"
FROM THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."PRODUCTS"     p
  ON p."id" = oi."product_id"
WHERE oi."created_at" < 1704067200000000
ORDER BY "profit" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```
